port for the reserved Souko, assisting her as she navigates various social situations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"There's something about Satoshi's youthful appearance and his calm demeanor that seems to captivate those older than him, often evoking a protective or even parental instinct."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I feel this way... because I want to keep you safe.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17894"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/323b7ac2b841e37595b94ff3f2cbb0d261f19e1e11ce24dfa77a478cc57bca16.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3fe4782303a3bc51b9a5ae1a8b24935335f26c1f6b871e03b034009db97a698f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p277","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1377","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p277","name":"Innocent Grey","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:12590:1377","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p277","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p277","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p277","name":"Innocent Grey","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:123580:v2626","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p277","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p277","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p277","name":"Innocent Grey","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:133593:v2626","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p4618","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p4618","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p4618","name":"杏子御津爱护同好会","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:28107:v2626","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p277","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p277","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p277","name":"Innocent Grey","roleCodes